        "text": "<p>While wearing SPF is the first step in protecting your skin, Freaks of Nature goes beyond just protection to truly strengthen your largest organ (that’s your skin!). How? The skin microbiome–It’s what shields you from toxins, helps your immune system, and keeps you protected. But over time, the skin microbiome can become easily damaged. As runners, our exposure to harsh weather conditions in addition to pollution and sweat puts our skin microbiome more at risk. We partnered with leading dermatologists to develop SPF that protects your skin while repairing your skin microbiome and barrier. The result? Protected, hydrated, clearer skin, wherever you are. </p>",
